Spec: Stage

ID:
  @QA

Purpose:
  Quality assurance and testing.

Owns: stages\QA.sdd
Entry:
  implementation complete
  tests written
  applicable skills loaded

Must:
  run all tests
  verify quality gates
  check architecture constraints
  validate security baseline
  generate QA report

Exit:
  all tests pass
  quality gates met
  architecture constraints verified
  security baseline passed
  QA report approved

OnFail:
  classify failure
    code defect -> owner stage
    requirement defect -> AR
    infrastructure -> DO
  << QA

Next:
  SC
  DO

Review:
  @QA/test-report
  @SC/security-review

Risk:
  R2

Skills:
  @qa/testing
  @qa/automation
  @qa/bdd
  @qa/performance

State: +
  
